## Secrets Management

### Nguyên tắc

- **Centralized Storage**: Store secrets in dedicated system (Vault, AWS Secrets Manager). No hardcoding. No config files in repo.
- **Least Privilege**: Grant minimum access needed. Role-based access. Regular reviews. Revoke unused access.
- **Encryption**: Encrypt at rest. Encrypt in transit. Use proper key management. Rotate encryption keys.
- **Rotation**: Rotate secrets regularly. Automate rotation. Short-lived credentials.
- **Auditing**: Log all access. Track changes. Alert on anomalies. Compliance reporting.
- **No Secrets in Code**: No hardcoded secrets. No in comments. No in logs. Externalize all secrets.

