### Secrets Management Checklist

- [ ] Secrets store configured (Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, etc.)
- [ ] Access controls defined
- [ ] Rotation policy established
- [ ] Encryption configured
- [ ] Auditing enabled
- [ ] Secrets in code removed
- [ ] Environment separation configured
- [ ] Emergency procedures documented
- [ ] Team trained on practices
- [ ] Compliance requirements met

### Anti Pattern - Secrets

- **Hardcoded Secrets**: API keys in code, passwords in config, secrets in git
- **Shared Accounts**: Generic passwords, shared credentials, no accountability
- **No Rotation**: Same passwords for years, no key rotation
- **Over-Permission**: Admin access for everyone, too many permissions
- **Secrets in Logs**: Passwords in logs, tokens in requests, sensitive data exposure
